        "findings": [
          "All ten named reports exactly match current source and audit order; twelve callers include arbitrary internal gap/suffix and arbitrary box-prefix functions. The two concrete isMatch controls have only fixed external syntax, with no free model variable in their decidable comparison.",
          "The UniformScans predecessor is frozen21/18 with actual source/audit pins and successful postchecks. Native169 evidence is byte-frozen by exact SHA, status/stdaxiom/compiler checked, and eleven actual Symbolic source/object imports are traversed recursively.",
          "The merged36-project pool rejects unequal duplicate source or object hashes; all current project pairs were independently rehashed read-only. Optional cache relocation applies to both pools. The later source-import DFS requires exactly this pool and supported external boundaries.",
